  "display_title": "Attach a Name Tag",
  "description": "*“It doesn't have to be me...”*\n\nIn the spring of his 18th year, An Ju-Ho had the name of his destined partner tattooed on his wrist. Whether it’s the power of fate or not, he keeps getting entangled with Yun Jae-Hui, the owner of that name. I didn’t care about fate, first love, or any of that nonsense, so why do I keep worrying about him and wondering about him? Is it because of the name on my wrist? Or is it just that…\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: The third story in the Sachungi: Neoreul Saenggakaneun Bom (사춘기: 너를 생각하는 봄) Collection.*",
